            of the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/identity+type"} identity type
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %msub
                    %mi{:mathvariant => "normal"} Id
                    %mi A
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                  %mi a
                  %mo ,
                  %mi b
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \mathrm{Id}_A(a, b)
            are
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/typal+equality"} typally equal
            to each other. This is equivalent to saying that every identity type
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %msub
                    %mi{:mathvariant => "normal"} Id
                    %mi A
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                  %mi a
