            is an
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/h-proposition"} h-proposition
          %h2#statement Statement
          %p There are multiple notions of uniqueness of identity proofs: for individual types, for type families and Tarski universes, and for the type theory itself.
          %h3#for_individual_types For individual types
          %p
            Given a type
            = succeed "," do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi A
